name limit ticket: tabs, price field, estimate and button text
show-buy Oil
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulOrderTabBuyNow
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulOrderTabLimit
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulLimitPrice
expect-text Button Buy
expect-text LabelPriceText Price:
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTabLimit
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField
expect-text Button Place limit order
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 95
expect-text FinanceOverhaulLimitHint at or below ₡95
expect-text LabelPriceText Est. cost (at limit)
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 2
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 50
expect-text LabelPriceValue ₡100
expect-no-overflow
# Long numbers must still fit inside the window.
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 99999
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 9999999
expect-text FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 9999999
expect-no-overflow
capture limit-ticket
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTabBuyNow
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulLimitPrice
expect-text Button Buy
expect-text LabelPriceText Price
capture buy-now-after-limit
expect-no-overflow
cleanup:
close-dialog
